    "paywall.disclosure.trial" : {
      "comment" : "Billing terms under the paywall purchase button when a free trial applies. %1$@ is the trial length, for example '14 days'. %2$@ is the price and period, for example '99 kr per month'. The last sentence says the subscription keeps renewing until the person cancels, which App Store review requires.",
